<title>ITALY: STET and Telecom merger signed.</title>
<headline>STET and Telecom merger signed.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The formal document to agree the merger of state-controlled telecoms operator Telecom Italia into telecoms holding company STET was formally signed on Tuesday, a joint statement from the two groups said.</p>
<p>From Friday July 18, STET will assume the name Telecom Italia SpA and from July 21 the new Telecom Italia shares will be quoted on the Milan bourse.</p>
<p>Later this year, the Italian Treasury plans to sell off a chunk of the combined telecoms group.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
